<title>CHINA: Shun Cheong year net returns to profit.</title>
<headline>Shun Cheong year net returns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.89 gain    vs 3.10 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0	    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	    vs 5.28 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    15.44 profit vs 8.05 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     518.47	 vs 396.40</p>
<p>    Company name		 Shun Cheong Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 4-9</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Shun Cheong is an electrical and mechanical engineering specialist.</p>
<p>Total dividend for the year is one H.K. cent vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
